<h2>Reset your password</h2>
<p>Hi {{name}},</p>
<p>We received a request to reset the password for your TaskFlow account. Click the button below to choose a new password:</p>
<a href="{{resetUrl}}" class="btn">Reset Password</a>
<p>This link expires in 1 hour. If you didn't request a password reset, you can safely ignore this email — your password won't be changed.</p>

